# LAMMPS Input Script for FCC Lattice of Aluminum

units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice fcc 4.05
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 4.05 4.05 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20.25 20.25 20.25)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 500 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20.25 20.25 20.25)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

mass 1 26.98

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

# Output settings
#dump 1 all xyz 100 structure.xyz

write_data structure.xyz
